<h1>New asserted environment</h1>

<em class="notice">
  Asserted environments can not be created here - there is no standalone
  form, because their ENVO term must come from an autoselect/autocomplete and
  they must belong to an object. Find or create one of the objects below,
  then use its radial menu (its "Asserted environments" panel) to add the
  assertion.
</em>

<ul>
  <% ENVIRONMENT_ASSERTABLE_TYPES.sort.each do |type| -%>
    <li>
      <%= type.underscore.humanize %>:
      <%= link_to 'Find', url_for(controller: type.tableize, action: :index) %>
      |
      <%= link_to 'Create new', url_for(controller: type.tableize, action: :new) %>
    </li>
  <% end -%>
</ul>
